 started with the grind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.840" end="00:38.340">I keep on stealin', but you trippin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.820" end="00:39.320">I'm countin' the times I hit, aye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.220" end="00:41.380">Shoot my shot, bullseye, you know I never miss, wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.380" end="00:43.270">Glocky by my side and a thotty girl on my dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.270" end="00:45.840">Catchin' bodies like Rodney, you know I'm gettin' hella rich</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.840" end="00:47.960">Bands, bands on my mind, fake fans on my line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.960" end="00:49.460">Did my first show in Henderson</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.150" end="00:50.650">'Cause I'm from the West side (West side)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.240" end="00:52.300">See my uzi in the back, goosebumps, don't stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.300" end="00:55.360">Alpha defo on my alley, yeah, that started with the grind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.360" end="00:57.310">No attachments, flexin', choppa sneeze, I said, "Bless you"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.310" end="00:59.670">I won't hesitate if you find a way you wanna be arrested</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.670" end="01:01.730">Better watch your talk, better watch your fucking step</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.730" end="01:04.180">I got Y2K shit, shawty love the way I'm dressin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.180" end="01:05.680">Off this Oxy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.010" end="01:06.510">I still make a buck, keep a woky (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.340" end="01:08.820">Keep a Rollie tucked, then I pop you like a ollie (like a ollie)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.820" end="01:10.910">Damn, this life of mine, yeah, I got these racks on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.910" end="01:13.360">Hoes seen sleepin', now they wait, no Dammy (no Dammy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.360" end="01:15.560">You still talkin' 'bout bitches 'cause you ain't got none</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.560" end="01:17.450">Yeah, you pay for your bitches, I'm on one fund (on one fund)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.450" end="01:19.910">And I get funds, and you ain't got it (got it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.910" end="01:22.070">Wanna make your day, can't fit inside my pocket</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.070" end="01:24.020">Goth bitches at the venue and they hop inside the mosh pit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.020" end="01:26.690">Party all this shit, shawty drop it in the cockpit (cockpit)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.690" end="01:28.830">Bro, watch where you steppin' 'cause you know my way legit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.830" end="01:30.620">Catch you steppin' on my shoes and you gon' catch a fist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.620" end="01:32.120">Goddamn, run it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.670" end="01:33.170">I keep on stealin', but you trippin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.090" end="01:34.590">I'm countin' the times I hit, aye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.100" end="01:35.810">Shoot my shot, bullseye, you know I never miss, wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.810" end="01:38.120">Glocky by my side and a thotty girl on my dick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.120" end="01:40.420">Catchin' bodies like Rodney, you know I'm gettin' hella rich</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.420" end="01:42.600">Bands, bands on my mind, fake fans on my line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.600" end="01:44.100">Did my first show in Henderson</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.990" end="01:45.490">'Cause I'm from the West side (West side)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.260" end="01:47.460">See my uzi in the back, goosebumps, don't stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.460" end="01:49.940">Alpha defo on my alley, yeah, that started with the grind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.940" end="01:51.440">I k